 * GREEN+ day = 19 shifts × 480 = 9,120 min  (106.0%)
 * AMBER  day = 17 shifts × 480 = 8,160 min  ( 94.9%)
 * AMBER2 day = 16 shifts × 480 = 7,680 min  ( 89.3%)
